BODY='''<section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/sagola-shop/">Sagola shop</a><span>/</span>Checkout</div><span class="eyebrow">NGETU / SECURE CHECKOUT</span><h1>Your equipment.<br>Your next step.</h1><p>Buy the exact products in your basket, with a bespoke quote available whenever you need advice or a package price.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap quote-layout"><aside><h2>Your order</h2><div id="checkout-basket"></div><p id="checkout-total"></p><p id="checkout-delivery" class="caption"></p><a class="text-link" href="/sagola-shop/#quote">Edit basket or request a bespoke quote →</a></aside><div><p id="checkout-message" role="status" tabindex="-1">Checking checkout availability…</p><form id="checkout-form" hidden><h2>Contact & delivery</h2><div class="form-grid"><label>Your name *<input name="name" required autocomplete="name" maxlength="100"></label><label>Company<input name="company" autocomplete="organization" maxlength="100"></label><label>Email *<input name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" maxlength="100"></label><label>Phone *<input name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" maxlength="35"></label><label>Street address *<input name="address" required autocomplete="address-line1" maxlength="100"></label><label>Address line 2<input name="address2" autocomplete="address-line2" maxlength="100"></label><label>City *<input name="city" required autocomplete="address-level2" maxlength="50"></label><label>Province *<select name="province" required><option value="">Choose province</option></select></label><label>Postal code *<input name="postcode" required pattern="[0-9]{4}" maxlength="4" autocomplete="postal-code" inputmode="numeric"></label></div><p>Delivery country: South Africa. Request a quote for locations outside the listed delivery areas.</p><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Leave blank<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><label class="checkbox"><input name="privacyAcknowledged" type="checkbox" required><span>I have read the <a href="/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">privacy notice</a>. *</span></label><label class="checkbox"><input name="termsAccepted" type="checkbox" required><span>I accept the <a href="/shop-sales-terms/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">sales, delivery and returns terms</a>. *</span></label><button class="btn" type="submit">Review final order →</button><p class="caption">Review the final total before continuing to the payment provider. Card details are never entered on this website.</p></form><section id="checkout-review" hidden aria-live="polite"><h2 id="order-heading">Review your order</h2><p id="order-reference"></p><div id="order-lines"></div><p id="order-total"></p><p id="order-status"></p><button type="button" id="pay-order" class="btn" hidden>Continue to secure payment →</button><button type="button" id="refresh-order" class="text-button">Refresh payment status</button><button type="button" id="new-order" class="text-button" hidden>Start a new checkout</button><p class="caption">Payment is confirmed only after verification from the payment provider. If you have paid and this page is still waiting, refresh the status or contact Kenneth with your order reference. Do not start another payment.</p></section></div></div></section>'''
